  "body": "Currently we have two places to call `Construct(C)`, one in [create an element](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-create-element) 6.2 (definition is non-null and synchronous) and another in [upgrade](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#concept-upgrade-an-element). Could these two be merged? Any reasons 6.2 can't be like 5.1-5.3?\n\nWe're needing a bit of different code paths for these two, as the former does not touch the construction stack, and wondering if these can be unified.\n\n@domenic @dominiccooney \n",
